(SAMPLE SYNTHETIC LIMITED - NOT A REAL COMPANY) Tj T*
(Independent Auditor's Report) Tj T*
(To the Members of Sample Synthetic Limited) Tj T*
(We have audited the consolidated financial statements, which comprise the balance sheet, the statement of profit and loss and the) Tj T*
(statement of cash flows.) Tj T*
(In our opinion the consolidated financial statements give a true and fair view.) Tj T*
(Emphasis of Matter: We draw attention to Note 38 regarding the recoverability of trade receivables. Our opinion is not modified in) Tj T*
(respect of this matter.) Tj T*
(Key audit matters include revenue recognition, because of the volume of year-end billing.) Tj T*
(The Company has not defaulted in repayment of loans or borrowings to any lender.) Tj T*
(The Company has given loans to related parties aggregating Rs. 120.00 crore, which are repayable on demand.) Tj T*
ET
